        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>1-3/4\" Diameter Classic Design Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis beautiful large 1-3/4\" diameter classic style cabinet knob is easy to grab because of its large size and it compliments traditionally decorated bathrooms and kitchens. It is made from solid brass to withstand years of use with looking great.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-CAB-CLASSIC1-size.gif?v=1704354597\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Classic Cabinet Knob Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/large-classic-shower-door-knob-sd-classic1\"><b>Classic Shower Door Knob</b></a> and  <a href=\"/products/classic-shower-door-knob-pair-sd-classic2\"><b>Classic Shower Door Knob Pair</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 7 different finish colors to match your room's decor. Packaged with #8-32 x 1-1/2\" screw for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Classic Cabinet Knob\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
